{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"**Library Files**\nAll generated ESM code is under `/output`:\n\n```text\n/output\n  lib/\n    cli/\n      program-name.mjs\n      messages.mjs\n      parser.mjs\n    jwt/\n      base64url.mjs\n      json-segment.mjs\n      hs256-openssl.mjs\n      encode-token.mjs\n    io/\n      write.mjs\n```\n\nLibrary files: [program-name.mjs](/output/lib/cli/program-name.mjs), [messages.mjs](/output/lib/cli/messages.mjs), [parser.mjs](/output/lib/cli/parser.mjs), [base64url.mjs](/output/lib/jwt/base64url.mjs), [json-segment.mjs](/output/lib/jwt/json-segment.mjs), [hs256-openssl.mjs](/output/lib/jwt/hs256-openssl.mjs), [encode-token.mjs](/output/lib/jwt/encode-token.mjs), [write.mjs](/output/lib/io/write.mjs)\n\n**Entry File**\n[test1.mjs](/output/test1.mjs)\n\n```js\nimport { parseCommandLine } from './lib/cli/parser.mjs';\nimport { writeStderrLine, writeStdoutLine } from './lib/io/write.mjs';\nimport { encodeToken } from './lib/jwt/encode-token.mjs';\n\nconst SECRET = 'my_secret_key';\n\nexport function main(argv = process.argv) {\n  const parseResult = parseCommandLine(argv);\n\n  if (parseResult.kind === 'help') {\n    writeStdoutLine(parseResult.text);\n    return parseResult.exitCode;\n  }\n\n  if (parseResult.kind === 'error') {\n    writeStderrLine(parseResult.text);\n    return parseResult.exitCode;\n  }\n\n  const token = encodeToken({ data: parseResult.payload }, SECRET);\n  writeStdoutLine(token);\n  return 0;\n}\n\nprocess.exitCode = main();\n```\n\nVerified against the 4 sample payload outputs, and the CLI behavior was matched for `--help`, missing `--payload`, `--p`, `--payload=`, `foo --help`, and `--help=1`."}}
